Package: nautilus-image-converter
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, imagemagick
Recommends: nautilus, libjpeg-turbo-progs
Description: Nautilus extension to resize, rotate and convert images
 Adds a "Transform Images..." entry to the Nautilus context menu for image
 files. It resizes, rotates or re-encodes each selected image, can preview
 the result before applying it, and can encode JPEGs to a target file size.
 .
 Conversion is done by ImageMagick. JPEG target-size encoding uses cjpeg
 from libjpeg-turbo-progs.
